---
// Footer.astro
---

<footer class="bg-[#0A1128] text-gray-300 border-t border-[#D4AF37]/30 pt-16 pb-12">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10 pb-12 border-b border-gray-800">
      
      <!-- Col 1: Author & Mission -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded border border-[#D4AF37] bg-[#0A1128] flex items-center justify-center text-[#D4AF37] font-playfair font-bold text-lg">
            CA
          </div>
          <span class="text-white font-montserrat font-extrabold tracking-wider text-lg">CSA ONLINESHOP<span class="text-[#D4AF37]">.</span></span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          A dedicated sanctuary of faith-filled literature, culinary wisdom, and reflective poetry by author, journalist, and culinary artist <strong>Christine A.</strong> Designed to anchor hearts, nourish minds, and bring God's living Word to life.
        </p>
        <div class="pt-2 text-xs text-[#D4AF37] font-montserrat uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">
          Ministry First • Truth Uncompromised
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: The 3-Site Ecosystem -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-white font-montserrat font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37]">The Ecosystem</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li>
            <a href="/" class="text-white hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition font-medium">CSA Online Shop (Flagship Store)</a>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-[11px]">Central author studio, catalog & reader community</p>
          </li>
          <li class="pt-1">
            <a href="https://spiritualbooks.csaonlineshop.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition flex items-center gap-1 font-medium">
              <span>The Divine Blueprint Library</span>
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-[#D4AF37]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
            </a>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-[11px]">75 Christian devotionals with multi-language audio</p>
          </li>
          <li class="pt-1">
            <a href="https://christinea.csatravellers.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-gray-300 hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition flex items-center gap-1 font-medium">
              <span>Christine A. Musings & Poetry</span>
              <svg class="w-3 h-3 text-[#D4AF37]" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
            </a>
            <p class="text-gray-400 text-[11px]">Lyrical poetry, reflections & travel journal</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Bookstore Shelves -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-white font-montserrat font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37]">Catalog Shelves</h3>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs">
          <li><a href="/catalog/#devotionals" class="hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition">Christian Devotionals & Typology</a></li>
          <li><a href="/catalog/#culinary" class="hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition">Culinary Arts & Quick Dinners</a></li>
          <li><a href="/catalog/#poetry" class="hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition">Poetry & Meditations</a></li>
          <li><a href="/catalog/#children" class="hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition">Children's Prophecy Detectives</a></li>
          <li><a href="/catalog/#discernment" class="hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition">Biblical Dream Interpretation</a></li>
          <li><a href="/catalog/#journals" class="hover:text-[#D4AF37] transition">Activity Books & Study Journals</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Sanctuary & Assurance -->
      <div class="space-y-3">
        <h3 class="text-white font-montserrat font-semibold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4AF37]">Instant Fulfillment</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
          All digital editions are delivered instantly upon purchase via secure 256-bit encrypted Gumroad checkout with direct-to-device PDF and ePub formats.
        </p>
        <div class="p-3 rounded bg-gray-900/60 border border-gray-800 space-y-1.5 text-[11px]">
          <div class="text-[#D4AF37] font-semibold flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path></svg>
            <span>Safe & Secure Purchases</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-400">100% money-back satisfaction guarantee within 14 days of reading.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Row -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between text-xs text-gray-500 gap-4">
      <div>
        © 2026 CSA Online Shop (csaonlineshop.com). All rights reserved. By Christine A.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-6 text-xs font-montserrat">
        <a href="/about/" class="hover:text-gray-300 transition">About the Author</a>
        <a href="/desk/" class="hover:text-gray-300 transition">Journal / Desk</a>
        <a href="/community/" class="hover:text-gray-300 transition">Community Hub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
